ver="true" class="max-w-3xl w-full text-lg page-cover-background:text-contrast-cover text-tint contrast-more:text-tint-strong clear-both">Binance USDS-M Futures historical market data details - instruments, data coverage and data collection specifics</p></header><div class="contents" data-content-ref-root=""><div class="flex flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-5 whitespace-pre-wrap"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-start self-start justify-start">Binance USDS-M Futures historical data for <strong class="font-bold">all its instruments</strong> is available since <strong class="font-bold">2019-11-17</strong>.</p><picture class="relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="relative overflow-hidden after:block after:absolute after:-inset-0 rounded-corners:rounded-sm circular-corners:rounded-2xl after:border-tint-subtle after:border after:rounded circular-corners:after:rounded-2xl rounded-corners:after:rounded-sm dark:after:mix-blend-plus-lighter after:pointer-events-none mx-auto"><a class="group flex flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 ring-1 ring-tint-subtle rounded-sm straight-corners:rounded-none circular-corners:rounded-2xl px-5 py-3 transition-shadow hover:ring-primary-hover" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/exchanges/binance-futures" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flex flex-col flex-1"><span class="text-base transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">https://api.tardis.dev/v1/exchanges/binance-futures</span><span class="text-base">api.tardis.dev</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-3 text-tint transition-all group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text