rline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/tardis-machine/quickstart">Tardis-machine</a></span> is a locally runnable server that exposes API allowing efficiently requesting historical market data for whole time periods in contrast to <span id="base-ui-_R_1uaaal39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/api/http-api-reference">HTTP API</a></span> that provides data only in minute by minute slices.</p><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start">See <span id="base-ui-_R_veaal39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/tardis-machine/quickstart">tardis-machine</a></span> docs.<!-- --></p></div></div></div></div><h3 id="captured-real-time-channels" class="text-lg @xs:text-xl @lg:text-2xl font-semibold heading pdf-heading block pr-6 pointer-fine:flex pointer-fine:items-baseline pointer-fine:pr-0 scroll-mt-(--content-scroll-margin) text-start self-start justify-start relative group/hash decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid column-first-of-type:pt-0 pt-[0.75em]" data-heading-reveal-wrapper="true"><span data-cover-aware-text="" class="pointer-fine:flex-1 z-1 justify-self-start max-w-full break-words page-cover-background:text-contrast-cover text-start self-start justify-start leading-snug">Captured real-time channels</span><span class="hash inline-grid grid-area-1-1 pointer-fine:h-[1em] border-0 opacity-0 pointer-events-none site-background rounded transition-opacity pointer-fine:pointer-events-auto pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:opacity-100 pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:opacity-100 [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:pointer-events-auto absolute [transform:translateY(0.17em)] pointer-fine:-ml-6 pointer-fine:relative pointer-fine:order-first pointer-fine:self-center pointer-fine:pr-2 pointer-fine:[transform:none] pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:order-last pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:ml-1 pointer-fine:[.flip-heading-hash_&amp;]:pl-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center p-1 pointer-fine:h-full pointer-fine:p-0 leading-snug" aria-label="Direct link to heading" href="#captured-real-time-channels"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon self-center transition-colors text-transparent pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-hover/hash:text-tint-strong pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:pointer-fine:group-focus-within/hash:text-tint-strong [.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-subtle contrast-more:[.hash-revealed_&amp;]:text-tint-strong size-4"><path fill="currentColor" d="M226.9 29c2.8-13-5.5-25.7-18.4-28.5S182.7 6 180 18.9L156.6 128 68.5 128c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l77.8 0-34.3 160-88 0c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l77.7 0-21.2 99c-2.8 13 5.5 25.7 18.4 28.5s25.7-5.5 28.5-18.4l23.4-109 155.4 0-21.2 99c-2.8 13 5.5 25.7 18.4 28.5s25.7-5.5 28.5-18.4l23.4-109 88 0c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24s-10.7-24-24-24l-77.7 0 34.3-160 88.1 0c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24s-10.7-24-24-24l-77.8 0 21.2-99c2.8-13-5.5-25.7-18.4-28.5S387.2 6 384.4 18.9l-23.4 109.1-155.4 0 21.2-99zM195.4 176l155.4 0-34.3 160-155.4 0 34.3-160z"/></svg></a></span></h3><picture class="relative decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl layout-wide:max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="relative overflow-hidden after:block after:absolute after:-inset-0 rounded-corners:rounded-sm circular-corners:rounded-2xl after:border-tint-subtle after:border after:rounded circular-corners:after:rounded-2xl rounded-corners:after:rounded-sm dark:after:mix-blend-plus-lighter after:pointer-events-none mx-auto"><a class="group flex flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 ring-1 ring-tint-subtle rounded-sm straight-corners:rounded-none circular-corners:rounded-2xl px-5 py-3 transition-shadow hover:ring-primary-hover" href="https://binance-docs.github.io/apidocs/futures/en/#websocket-market-streams" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="flex flex-col flex-1"><span class="text-base transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">https://binance-docs.github.io/apidocs/futures/en/#websocket-market-streams</span><span class="text-base">binance-docs.github.io</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-3 text-tint transition-all group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-primary"><path fill="currentColor" d="M313.5 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-200 200c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0s-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l183-183-183-183c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l200 200z"/></svg></a></div><figcaption class="text-xs text-center text-tint mt-2">See Binance USDS-M Futures WebSocket API docs providing documentation for each captured channel&#x27;s format</figcaption></picture><div class="hint transition-colors rounded-corners:rounded-md circular-corners:rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-info border-info theme-muted-tint:bg-info-solid/2 [html.sidebar-filled.theme-bold.tint_&amp;]:bg-info-solid/2 text-sm grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid" aria-label="Information" role="note"><div class="py-4 pl-4 text-info-subtle contrast-more:text-info"><svg viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon size-[1.2em] mt-px leading-normal"><path fill="currentColor" d="M256 48a208 208 0 1 1 0 416 208 208 0 1 1 0-416zm0 464a256 256 0 1 0 0-512 256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM216 336c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l80 0c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24s-10.7-24-24-24l-8 0 0-88c0-13.3-10.7-24-24-24l-48 0c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24s10.7 24 24 24l24 0 0 64-24 0zm40-144a32 32 0 1 0 0-64 32 32 0 1 0 0 64z"/></svg></div><div class="p-4 pl-3 empty:p-0 -row-end-1 -col-end-1 min-w-0 space-y-3 [&amp;_.hint]:border [&amp;_pre]:border [&amp;_pre]:border-neutral"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid text-neutral-strong [&amp;_.can-override-bg]:bg-neutral-active [&amp;_.can-override-text]:text-neutral-strong flip-heading-hash text-start self-start justify-start">Click any channel below to see <span id="base-ui-_R_fndl39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="/api/http-api-reference#data-feeds-exchange">HTTP API</a></span> response with historical data recorded for it.</p></div></div><ul class="min-w-0 space-y-2 decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full"><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_fm1el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2024-01-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22trade%22}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">trade<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> Public futures trade executions stream</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_fm2el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2024-01-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22depth%22,%22symbols%22:[%22btcusdt%22]}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">depth<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> Incremental futures order book updates stream. Recorded with the fastest API cadence available at the time: until 2020-01-07 it was subscribed as <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">depth@100ms</code> (100ms updates), after that as <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">depth@0ms</code> (real-time dynamically adjusted update speed).</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_v63el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2024-01-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22depthSnapshot%22,%22symbols%22:[%22btcusdt%22]}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">depthSnapshot<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> — generated channel Binance USDS-M Futures real-time WebSocket API <strong class="font-bold">does not provide initial order book snapshots</strong>. To overcome this issue we fetch initial order book snapshots from REST API and store them together with the rest of the WebSocket messages — top 1000 levels. Such snapshot messages are marked with <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">&quot;stream&quot;:&quot;&lt;symbol&gt;@depthSnapshot&quot;</code> and <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">&quot;generated&quot;:true</code> fields.<!-- --></p><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start">During data collection integrity of order book incremental updates is being validated using <span id="base-ui-_R_va3el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://binance-docs.github.io/apidocs/futures/en/#how-to-manage-a-local-order-book-correctly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sequence numbers<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> provided by real-time feed (<code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">pu</code> and <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">u</code> fields) — in case of detecting missed message WebSocket connection is being restarted. We also validate if initial book snapshot fetched from REST API overlaps with received <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">depth</code> messages.</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_fm4el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2024-01-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22bookTicker%22,%22symbols%22:[%22btcusdt%22]}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bookTicker<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> Best bid and best ask updates stream</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseu