 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_v68el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2026-05-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22premiumIndex%22,%22symbols%22:[%22btcusdt%22]}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">premiumIndex<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> — generated channel, available since <strong class="font-bold">2026-04-11</strong></p><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start">Snapshots are fetched from the REST <span id="base-ui-_R_va8el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://developers.binance.com/docs/derivatives/usds-margined-futures/market-data/rest-api/Mark-Price" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mark price endpoint<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-icon ml-0.5 inline size-3 links-accent:text-tint-subtle"><path fill="currentColor" d="M360 64c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 240c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24s-24-10.7-24-24l0-182.1-295 295c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0S-2.3 416.4 7 407l295-295-182.1 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l240 0z"/></svg></a></span> about every 6 seconds for all instruments. The recorder splits the REST response into one generated message per instrument, marked with <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">&quot;stream&quot;:&quot;&lt;symbol&gt;@premiumIndex&quot;</code> and <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">&quot;generated&quot;:true</code> fields. This channel includes the <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">interestRate</code> field that is not present on the WebSocket <code class="py-px px-1.5 min-w-6.5 justify-center items-center ring-1 ring-inset ring-tint bg-tint rounded-sm text-[.875em] leading-[calc(max(1.20em,1.25rem))] break-words hyphens-none">markPrice</code> stream.</p></div></li><li class="leading-normal flex items-start"><div class="text-base leading-normal mr-1 flex min-h-lh min-w-6 items-center justify-center text-tint"><div class="before:content-(--pseudoBefore--content) before:font-var" style="--pseudoBefore--content:&#x27;•&#x27;;--font-family:Arial;font-size:min(1.5em, 24px);line-height:1"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col space-y-2"><p data-cover-aware-text="" class="page-cover-background:[&amp;:not(:has(.button,input))]:text-contrast-cover has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 max-w-3xl w-full print:break-inside-avoid min-h-lh [h2]:pt-0 [h3]:pt-0 [h4]:pt-0 mx-0 text-start self-start justify-start"><span id="base-ui-_R_v69el39bsnqj6iv5ubsnpfivb_"><a class="underline decoration-[max(0.07em,1px)] underline-offset-2 links-accent:underline-offset-4 links-default:decoration-primary/6 links-default:text-primary-subtle hover:links-default:text-primary-strong contrast-more:links-default:text-primary contrast-more:hover:links-default:text-primary-strong links-accent:decoration-primary-subtle hover:links-accent:decoration-[3px] hover:links-accent:[text-decoration-skip-ink:none] transition-all duration-100" href="https://api.tardis.dev/v1/data-feeds/binance-futures?from=2026-05-01&amp;filters=[{%22channel%22:%22indexConstituents%22,%22symbols%22:[%22btcusdt%22]}]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">indexConstituents<svg viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor" style="overflow:visible" class="gb-ico